<doc id="189169" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=189169" title="Kabiskopan Agung Dar-es-Salaam">
Kabiskopan Agung Dar-es-Salaam

Kabiskopan Agung Dar-es-Salaam (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Daressalaamensis) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan%20agung"&gt;kabiskopan agung&lt;/a&gt; Metropolitan Latin &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Tanzania"&gt;Tanzania&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Greja%20induk"&gt;Greja induk&lt;/a&gt; kabiskopan agung kasebut lan kursi biskop agunge menika &lt;a href="Katedral%20Santo%20Yusuf%2C%20Dar%20es%20Salaam"&gt;Katedral Santo Yusuf&lt;/a&gt;. Biskop agung Dar-es-Salaam saiki menika Kardinal &lt;a href="Polycarp%20Pengo"&gt;Polycarp Pengo&lt;/a&gt;, sing dimunggahke dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Yohanes%20Paulus%20II"&gt;Paus Yohanes Paulus II&lt;/a&gt; ing 22 Juli 1992.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<ul>
<li>Didegake minangka &lt;a href="prefek%20apostolik"&gt;Prefektur Apostolik&lt;/a&gt; Zanguebar Kidul dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Leo%20XIII"&gt;Paus Leo XIII&lt;/a&gt; ing 16 November 1887, ing kawasan sing diparo saka &lt;a href="Vikariat%20Apostolik%20Zanguebar"&gt;Vikariat Apostolik Zanguebar&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Dimunggahke dadi &lt;a href="vikariat%20apostolik"&gt;Vikariat Apostolik&lt;/a&gt; Zanguebar Kidul ing 15 September 1902. Ganti jeneng dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Pius%20X"&gt;Paus Pius X&lt;/a&gt; dadi Vikariat Apostolik Dar-es-Salaam ing 10 Agustus 1906.</li>
<li>Kelangan wilayah ing 1913.11.12 kanggo pangadegan &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Apostolik%20Lindi"&gt;Prefektur Apostolik Lindi&lt;/a&gt; lan maneh ing 1922.03.03 kanggo pangadegan &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Apostolik%20Iringa"&gt;Prefektur Apostolik Iringa&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Dimunggahke dadi &lt;a href="biskop%20metropolitan"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Pius%20XII"&gt;Paus Pius XII&lt;/a&gt; ing 25 Maret 1953</li>
<li>Kelangan wilayah ing 1964.04.21: kanggo pangadegan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Mahenge"&gt;Kabiskopan Mahenge&lt;/a&gt; lan maneh ing 1964.12.12 kanggo pangadegan &lt;a href="Administrasi%20Apostolik%20Zanzibar%20lan%20Pemba"&gt;Administrasi Apostolik Zanzibar lan Pemba&lt;/a&gt; (saiki &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Zanzibar"&gt;Kabiskopan Zanzibar&lt;/a&gt;, kalorone menika suffragane</li>
<li>Dikunjungi dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Yohanes%20Paulus%20II"&gt;Paus Yohanes Paulus II&lt;/a&gt; ing September 1990.</li>
<h2>Provinsi</h2>
</ul>
