Kabiskopan Kopenhagen (#ALIH) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Greja%20Dhenemarken"&gt;Greja Dhenemarken&lt;/a&gt; beraliran &lt;a href="Lutheran%20Injili"&gt;Lutheran Injili&lt;/a&gt;. Biskop Kopenhagen menika &lt;a href="Peter%20Skov-Jakobsen"&gt;Peter Skov-Jakobsen&lt;/a&gt;, sing ngeganteni &lt;a href="Erik%20Normann%20Svendsen"&gt;Erik Normann Svendsen&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2009. &lt;a href="Katedral"&gt;Katedral&lt;/a&gt; kabiskopan menika &lt;a href="Greja%20Dewi%20Maria%2C%20Kopenhagen"&gt;Katedral Dewi Maria&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kopenhagen"&gt;Kopenhagen&lt;/a&gt;. Biskop Kopenhagen nduweni status khusus minangka Biskop &lt;a href="Primat"&gt;Primat&lt;/a&gt; utawa biskop sing utamine saka para biskop ing Dhenemarken, nanging ora entuk gelar "biskop agung" amargi ora nduweni status metropolitan. Pimpinan paling dhuwur Greja menika &lt;a href="Margrethe%20II%20saka%20Dhenemarken"&gt;Ratu Dhenemarken&lt;/a&gt; lan ketuwa administrasi menika &lt;a href="Mantri%20Urusan%20Grejawi%20%28Dhenemarken%29"&gt;Mantri Urusan Grejawi&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kronologi</h2>
<ul>
<li>Didegake minangka Kabiskopan Kopenhagen ing taun 1922, diparo saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Sj%C3%A6lland"&gt;Kabiskopan Sjælland&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<h2>Pratelan biskop</h2>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Harald%20Ostenfeld"&gt;Harald Ostenfeld&lt;/a&gt; (1922–1934), biyen &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Sj%C3%A6lland"&gt;Biskop Sjælland&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Hans%20Fuglsang%20Damgaard"&gt;Hans Fuglsang Damgaard&lt;/a&gt; (1934–1960)</li>
