Kabiskopan Helsingør (#ALIH) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Greja%20Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Greja Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt; beraliran &lt;a href="Lutheran%20Injili"&gt;Lutheran Injili&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan kasebut kalebu &lt;a href="Daerah%20Ibukutha%20Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Daerah Ibukutha Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt; kajaba munisipalitas-munisipalitas inti &lt;a href="Munisipalitas%20Kopenhagen"&gt;Kopenhagen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Munisipalitas%20Frederiksberg"&gt;Frederiksberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Munisipalitas%20T%C3%A5rnby"&gt;Tårnby&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Munisipalitas%20Drag%C3%B8r"&gt;Dragør&lt;/a&gt;. Diparo saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kopenhagen"&gt;Kabiskopan Kopenhagen&lt;/a&gt; ing 1 Januari 1961, 10 kabiskopan ana ing greja nagara Dhenemarken. Greja utamine menika &lt;a href="Greja%20Santo%20Olaf%2C%20Helsing%C3%B8r"&gt;Katedral Santo Olaf&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Helsing%C3%B8r"&gt;Helsingør&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kronologi</h2>
<ul>
<li>Didegake minangka Kabiskopan Helsingør ing 1 Januari 1961, diparo saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kopenhagen%20%28Greja%20Dh%C3%A8nemarken%29"&gt;Kabiskopan Kopenhagen&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Pratelan biskop</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="J.B.%20Leer-Andersen"&gt;J.B. Leer-Andersen&lt;/a&gt; (1961–1980)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Johannes%20Johansen"&gt;Johannes Johansen&lt;/a&gt; (1980–1995)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Lise-Lotte%20Rebel"&gt;Lise-Lotte Rebel&lt;/a&gt; (1995–2021)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Peter%20Birch%20%28biskop%20Dh%C3%A8nemarken%29"&gt;Peter Birch&lt;/a&gt; (2021–saiki)</li>
</ul>
