Kabiskopan Xai-Xai (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Xai-Xaien(sis)) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing kutha &lt;a href="Xai-Xai"&gt;Xai-Xai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Grejawi"&gt;Provinsi Grejawi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Maputo"&gt;Maputo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mozambik"&gt;Mozambik&lt;/a&gt;.
