<doc id="189479" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=189479" title="Kabiskopan Agung Kigali">
Kabiskopan Agung Kigali

Kabiskopan Agung Kigali (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Kigaliensis) yaiku wilayah grejawi utawa &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Rwanda"&gt;Rwanda&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan kasebut didegake saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kabgayi"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Kabgayi&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Paulus%20VI"&gt;Paus Paulus VI&lt;/a&gt; ing 10 April 1976, karo &lt;a href="biskop%20suffragan"&gt;tahta-tahta suffragan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Butare"&gt;Butare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Byumba"&gt;Byumba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Cyangugu"&gt;Cyangugu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Gikongoro"&gt;Gikongoro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kabgayi"&gt;Kabgayi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kibungo"&gt;Kibungo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Nyundo"&gt;Nyundo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Ruhengeri"&gt;Ruhengeri&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan kasebut menika siji-sijine kabiskopan agung ing Rwanda.
&lt;a href="Greja%20induk"&gt;Greja induk&lt;/a&gt; saka kabiskopan agung kasebut lan uga tahta biskop agunge menika &lt;a href="Katedral%20Santo%20Mikael%20%28Kigali%2C%20Ville%20de%20Kigali%2C%20Rwanda%29"&gt;Katedral Santo Mikael&lt;/a&gt;.
