<doc id="189505" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=189505" title="Kabiskopan Agung Montevideo">
Kabiskopan Agung Montevideo

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Didegake minangka &lt;a href="Vikariat%20Apostolik"&gt;Vikariat Apostolik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Montevideo"&gt;Montevideo&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Gregorius%20XVI"&gt;Paus Gregorius XVI&lt;/a&gt; ing 14 Agustus 1832, vikariat kasebut dimunggahke dadi Kabiskopan Montevideo ing 13 Juli 1878 dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Leo%20XIII"&gt;Paus Leo XIII&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan kasebut dimunggahke dadi &lt;a href="biskop%20metropolitan"&gt;kabiskopan agung metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; ing 14 April 1897.
Kabiskopan agung kasebut dadi &lt;a href="biskop%20metropolitan"&gt;Metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="biskop%20sufragan"&gt;tahta-tahta ngisorane&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Canelones"&gt;Canelones&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Florida"&gt;Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Maldonado%E2%80%93Punta%20del%20Este"&gt;Maldonado–Punta del Este&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Melo"&gt;Melo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Mercedes"&gt;Mercedes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Minas"&gt;Minas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Salto"&gt;Salto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20San%20Jos%C3%A9%20de%20Mayo"&gt;San José de Mayo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Tacuaremb%C3%B3"&gt;Tacuarembó&lt;/a&gt;.
Montevideo menika siji-sijine kabiskopan agung ing Uruguay lan biskop agunge dideleng minangka pimpinan &lt;a href="Katulik%20Roma%20ing%20Uruguay"&gt;Greja Uruguay&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Greja%20induk"&gt;Greja induk&lt;/a&gt; saka kabiskopan agung kasebut lan kursi biskop agunge menika &lt;a href="Katedral%20Metropolitan%20Montevideo"&gt;Katedral Metropolitan Montevideo&lt;/a&gt;.
Biskop agung Montevideo saiki menika &lt;a href="Daniel%20Sturla"&gt;Daniel Sturla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Salesian%20Don%20Bosco"&gt;SDB&lt;/a&gt;, sawise dimunggahke ing 9 Maret 2014. Setaun banjur kuwi, ia dimunggahke dadi &lt;a href="Kardinal"&gt;Kardinal&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Fransiskus"&gt;Paus Fransiskus&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Organisasi</h2>
Organisasi.
Kabiskopan Agung Montevideo keparo ing &lt;a href="Pratelan%20greja%20Katulik%20ing%20Uruguay%23Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Montevideo"&gt;sepuluh Zona Pastoral&lt;/a&gt;.
