<li>&lt;a href="Pedro%20Alc%C3%A1ntara%20Jim%C3%A9nez"&gt;Pedro Alcántara Jiménez&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Premonstratensian"&gt;OPraem&lt;/a&gt; (1830 - 1843)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Jacinto%20Vera%20y%20Dur%C3%A1n"&gt;Jacinto Vera y Durán&lt;/a&gt; (1859 - 1881)</li>
