Keihan Electric Railway Company, Ltd. (京阪電気鉄道株式会社, Keihan Denki Tetsudō Kabushiki-gaisha) yaiku operator sepur Jepang ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Osaka"&gt;Prefektur Osaka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Kyoto"&gt;Kyoto&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Shiga"&gt;Shiga&lt;/a&gt;. Iku uga dikenal minangka "Keihan" (京阪, "Keihan"), "Keihan Dentetsu" (京阪電鉄, "Keihan Dentetsu") utawa "Keihan Densha" (京阪電車, "Keihan Densha"). Iku anak perusahaan saka Keihan Holdings, Ltd.
