<doc id="189617" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=189617" title="Nozomi (sepur)">
Nozomi (sepur)

Nozomi (のぞみ, Nozomi "Angen-angen" utawa "Pangarep-arep") yaiku layanan sepur paling cepet ing jalur &lt;a href="Tokaido%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tokaido&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="San%27y%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;San'yō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; ing Jepang. Sepur mandheg mung ing stasiun paling gedhe, lan bebarengan babagan antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Shin-Ōsaka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Hakata"&gt;Hakata&lt;/a&gt;, sepur Nozomi nggunakake Shinkansen &lt;a href="N700%20Series%20Shinkansen"&gt;Seri N700&lt;/a&gt; sing tekan kacepetan 300 km/h. Lelungan antarane &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt; kanthi jarak 515 km, udakara njupuk 2 jam 21 menit ing layanan paling cepet "Nozomi".
Sepur mandheg ing stasiun luwih sithik tinimbang sepur &lt;a href="Hikari%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Hikari&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kodama%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Kodama&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Tōkaidō Shinkansen antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Shin-Ōsaka&lt;/a&gt;, sepur Nozomi mung mandheg ing &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shinagawa"&gt;Shinagawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Yokohama"&gt;Shin-Yokohama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Nagoya"&gt;Nagoya&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Ky%C5%8Dto"&gt;Kyōto&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Sanyō Shinkansen antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Shin-Ōsaka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Hakata"&gt;Hakata&lt;/a&gt;, kabeh sepur Nozomi mandheg ing &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Kobe"&gt;Shin-Kobe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Okayama"&gt;Okayama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Hiroshima"&gt;Hiroshima&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kokura"&gt;Kokura&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi sepur tartamtu uga mandheg ing stasiun tambahan. &lt;a href="Japan%20Rail%20Pass"&gt;Japan Rail Pass&lt;/a&gt; ora ditrapake kanggo lelungan nganggo sepur Nozomi.
