<doc id="189954" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=189954" title="Kabiskopan Agung Malta">
Kabiskopan Agung Malta

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Kabiskopan Agung Malta (&lt;a href="Basa%20Malta"&gt;Basa Malta&lt;/a&gt;: Arċidjoċesi ta' Malta) yaiku kabiskopan agung metropolitan &lt;a href="Ritus%20Latin"&gt;Ritus Latin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik"&gt;Greja Katulik&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Malta"&gt;Malta&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Asal usul</h2>
Asal usul.
Tradisi ngarani nek &lt;a href="Rasul%20Paulus"&gt;Santo Paulus&lt;/a&gt; dhewe sing ngadegake kabiskopan Malta ing taun 60 Masehi nalika ia nahbiske gubernur Romawi, &lt;a href="Santo%20Publius"&gt;Publius&lt;/a&gt;, wong suci Malta kapisan, minangka biskop Malta kapisan. Malta dadi salah sijining nagara kapisan sing lumebu agami Kristen ing donya lan nagara kapisan sing ngalamine ing donya Kulon. Kabiskopan Malta didadike tahta suffragan saka Metropolitan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Palermo"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Palermo&lt;/a&gt; liwat bulla kepausan &lt;a href="Paus%20Adrianus%20IV"&gt;Paus Adrianus IV&lt;/a&gt; ing 10 Juli 1156 lan dikonfirmasike dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Aleksander%20III"&gt;Paus Aleksander III&lt;/a&gt; ing 26 April 1160. Bekas Kabiskopan Malta, sing menika salah sijining kabiskopan paling tuwa ing donya, dimunggahke dadi kabiskopan agung ing 1 Januari 1944. Sadurunge 1864, Kabiskopan Malta kalebu pulo-pulo Malta, Gozo lan Comino. Ing 22 September 1864, wilayah kabiskopan kasebut diparo saka wilayah &lt;a href="Gozo"&gt;Gozo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cosimo"&gt;Cosimo&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="Paus%20Pius%20IX"&gt;Paus Pius IX&lt;/a&gt; ngadegake &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Gozo"&gt;Kabiskopan Gozo&lt;/a&gt; sing dadi &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; suffragan kanggo &lt;a href="Malta"&gt;Malta&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Suffragan</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Gozo"&gt;Kabiskopan Gozo&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
