Sergius (Chashin)

Metropolitan Sergius (&lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Митрополит Сергий, uga diromanisasike dadi Sergy, Sergiy, Sergey utawa Sergei, nama sekuler Nikolay Nikolayevich Chashin, &lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Николай Николаевич Чашин; #ALIH) yaiku biskop &lt;a href="Greja%20Ortodoks%20Ruslan"&gt;Greja Ortodoks Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, Metropolitan saka &lt;a href="Eparki%20Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-wetan"&gt;Asia Kidul-wetan&lt;/a&gt;.
Ia dadi kepala Sekretariat Administratif Patriarki Moskwa lan anggota Badan Antar-Dewan Greja Ortodoks Ruslan sawise 2009. Ing 2018, ia dadi primat &lt;a href="Eksarkat%20Patriarkat%20Asia%20Kidul-wetan"&gt;Eksarkat Patriarkat Asia Kidul-wetan&lt;/a&gt;.
