<doc id="190551" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=190551" title="Linimo">
Linimo

Linimo (リニモ, Rinimo), kanthi resmi Jalur Tobu Kyuryo Aichi Rapid Transit (愛知高速交通東部丘陵線, Aichi Kōsoku Kōtsū Tōbu Kyūryō-sen) yaiku jalur &lt;a href="maglev"&gt;sepur levitasi magnetik&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Aichi"&gt;Prefektur Aichi&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang, cedhak kutha &lt;a href="Nagoya"&gt;Nagoya&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika utamane dibangun kanggo ngladeni situs pameran &lt;a href="Expo%202005"&gt;Expo 2005&lt;/a&gt;, jalur kasebut saiki digunakake kanggo ngladeni komunitas lokal.
Linimo diduweni lan dilakokno dening Aichi Rapid Transit Company, Ltd. (愛知高速交通株式会社, Aichi Kōsoku Kōtsū kabushiki gaisha) lan minangka maglev komersial kapisan ing Jepang sing nggunakake teknologi jinis &lt;a href="High%20Speed%20Surface%20Transport"&gt;High Speed Surface Transport&lt;/a&gt; (HSST). Iku uga minangka maglev kutha komersial tanpa awak kapisan ing donya. Ana sawetara sumber sing ambigu nggambarake "tanpa awak" minangka "otomatis" utawa nglirwakake kondisi kasebut nalika nggawe pratelan kasebut, nanging Linimo sejatine minangka maglev kutha komersial kaping papat sing dioperasikake ing donya, sadurunge &lt;a href="Maglev%23Birmingham%2C%20Inggris%2C%201984%E2%80%931995"&gt;Birmingham Maglev&lt;/a&gt; (1984–1995), &lt;a href="M-Bahn"&gt;Berlin M-Bahn&lt;/a&gt; (1989–1991) lan &lt;a href="Shanghai%20Maglev%20Train"&gt;Shanghai Maglev&lt;/a&gt; (dibukak ing 2004).
