<doc id="190696" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=190696" title="Bernike">
Bernike

Berenike saking Kilikia, uga diarani minangka Yulia Berenike lan kadhangkala diarani Bernike (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: Βερενίκη, Bereníkē; 28 M – sawise 81), yaiku &lt;a href="nagara%20klien"&gt;ratu klien&lt;/a&gt; Yahudi saka &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Romawi"&gt;Kakaisaran Romawi&lt;/a&gt; ing paruh kapindho abad kaping 1. Bernike menika anggota &lt;a href="Dinasti%20Herodian"&gt;Dinasti Herodian&lt;/a&gt; sing mrentah provinsi &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Yudea"&gt;Yudea&lt;/a&gt; antarane 39 SM lan 92 M. Ia menika putri saka Raja &lt;a href="Agripa%20I"&gt;Herodes Agripa I&lt;/a&gt; lan saudari saka Raja &lt;a href="Agripa%20II"&gt;Herodes Agripa II&lt;/a&gt;.
Informasi babagan kauripan lan latar mburine sing sithik sabagean gedhe asale saka sajarawan wiwitan &lt;a href="Flavius%20Josephus"&gt;Flavius Josephus&lt;/a&gt;, sing nyritani sajarah wong &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; lan nulis cathetan &lt;a href="Perang%20Yahudi-Romawi%20Kapisan"&gt;Pamberontakan Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taun 67. &lt;a href="Suetonius"&gt;Suetonius&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tacitus"&gt;Tacitus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dio%20Cassius"&gt;Dio Cassius&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Aurelius%20Victor"&gt;Aurelius Victor&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Juvenal"&gt;Juvenal&lt;/a&gt;, uga nyritanine. Ia uga diarani ing Kisah Para Rasul 25:13; 23; 26:30.
